{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/a729s21hfo7tbc9gtnzhe74trnklei7.mp3","text":"博士，这些是今天的工作——是啊，堆积如山呢，一起加油吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_002.mp3","text":"伊芙利特又在闹了吗？抱歉，之后我会责备她的。"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_003.mp3","text":"Zzzzz......嗯？呃，我只是想小睡一下......果然还是不太适应在白天工作。"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_004.mp3","text":"离开莱茵生命的理由？因为发生过很多事，我也不知道该从什么时候说起......"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/coib8i1g1jq79mfwnf2r5a4pkb22ia7.mp3","text":"塞雷娅这个名字,您听过吗？她以前和我一样，也是莱茵生命的科学家——然后，她也是让伊芙利特诞生的人之一......","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/fsczglrslimsgad096i8ymkcn5wblxn.mp3","text":"莱茵生命所做的有关生命的研究，已经到了尝试将源石碎片植入身体的地步......对不起，我们还是换个话题吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/0t1qty8uzv8arxjnsp9r9w4kug2lk56.mp3","text":"塞雷娅？您说她在罗德岛？是来找伊芙利特吗......那时候她明明头也不回地就离开了，为什么现在还要......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/ftgecj4m4jlt7vyfzq6x2uohkcd5nkt.mp3","text":"我不会让伊芙利特见塞雷娅的。也请您相信，我这样做，是对伊芙利特好......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/fta49fy53se9ahq41x0ofdqen72qk84.mp3","text":"和我一样，您也在试图清除矿石病吗？听说罗德岛的医疗技术开发也与您有关。呵呵，对我们这些研究者来说，这真是让人憧憬呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_010.mp3","text":"......博士，睡着了吗？算了，剩下的工作我来做吧。"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/24l8xt0vzvnwq4v3lcjppz51zozbz2d.mp3","text":"奥利维亚·赫默，莱茵生命医学研究所的源石研究者。清除这个世界上所有的矿石病，这是我的愿望，即使为此面临生命危险也不会改变。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/9ark4j185nfhp4pwthl3zgvvbpr9yhq.mp3","text":"我会好好运用这份新的力量。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/7zhml6q06c76rxf9mp3v7uea5os5r5n.mp3","text":"我开发的药物非常有效吗？太好了，比起晋升，这个消息更让我高兴。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/7t4tcuo0npkaaxga9x0vrytnug7suxr.mp3","text":"博士，我等待着，等待着从这片大地上彻底清除矿石病的那天，与您并肩作战，共同研究，这一天，也许终会到来......","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/oh6jp0eb4rpkbq64jffuj55f59afs6q.mp3","text":"明白，我会做好支援工作。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/bgp27luqwe2vsoi63tgagq19obv221c.mp3","text":"队员们，全力以赴地战斗吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/ln8qmnune6fu2py7u0dj9ee0llsn44s.mp3","text":"这场战斗，也是源石的错吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/sitdpuum6q4cgw84l720e3q52fvkwt7.mp3","text":"观察并确定他们的感染类型，这对实验很有用。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_021.mp3","text":"博士，让我去吧。"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_022.mp3","text":"没有异常。"}],"部署":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_023.mp3","text":"集中精力。"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_024.mp3","text":"保持冷静。"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/8kg17pswz511qv0zccam6xlp610xo35.mp3","text":"我会治好你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/er5diuplvdybf98np415sejz7bqtdi4.mp3","text":"别慌张。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/pojxa4fa5o54o2cwpomaml5xu3umk4i.mp3","text":"去吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/pjhe5lxn7x0rk6gytoccqjh3uhcwt8h.mp3","text":"帮助大家。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/7j7e8pvtep7hju4hgrrt35xcb180868.mp3","text":"为了战胜比现在更强的敌人，我们难道也要更多利用源石的力量......吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/brjd8i14a8ywe994fzp5dh9j5thk1ib.mp3","text":"医疗组请马上进行组织采取，这将成为此地区的感染样本。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/q4npvipb9d8hqr57h2z384geq13uj5c.mp3","text":"请伤者冷静下来，医疗组会为各位进行治疗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/igsuh52o5hy0l0gmxbvm5v3wwtg0p6s.mp3","text":"......现在不是沮丧的时候，我们必须立刻撤退。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/f3acbpdqflc2u6s1i9nq2ejob5josrs.mp3","text":"这个房间......糟糕，是那种会让人产生睡意的设计风格！","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/i4rzg4llooggmgeguqcp32bctpe38e9.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/85zn88nu7oyvq8eh1j5cxfj3wgymhvm.mp3","text":"博士，您最近变得更温柔了呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_037.mp3","text":"明日方舟。"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/0ahdvkaeu0adv69q98dnp73vv2d1dcv.mp3","text":"博士，您看到伊芙利特了吗？外面在放烟花，我很担心......嗯，带她回房间睡觉之后，我打算去实验室。我没有忘记这是什么日子，只是想用这种方式来面对新的一年，面对未来。新年快乐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/7lh9v9qmi2zsmik9ug79af1189mer6c.mp3","text":"您好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_108_silent/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/4eejblq29d71bb19tp6p7cinm57su9v.mp3","text":"博士，这些是今天的工作——是啊，堆积如山呢，一起加油吧。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/7zi0vylxxljhvgmyapyo3kx1xqgt7nu.mp3","text":"伊芙利特又在闹了吗？抱歉，之后我会责备她的。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/e99s65eru4klh74wl339eh2cdp0wp2y.mp3","text":"Zzzzz......嗯？呃，我只是想小睡一下......果然还是不太适应在白天工作。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/0kp9pcxagr0z1xjry3tzfxt5hfl39p3.mp3","text":"离开莱茵生命的理由？因为发生过很多事，我也不知道该从什么时候说起......","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/7zv472bf8fzewpveri6bhjd15qnaqrj.mp3","text":"塞雷娅这个名字,您听过吗？她以前和我一样，也是莱茵生命的科学家——然后，她也是让伊芙利特诞生的人之一......","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/7r24xtdzoso8wa52msq1yxw3k0n7dpe.mp3","text":"莱茵生命所做的有关生命的研究，已经到了尝试将源石碎片植入身体的地步......对不起，我们还是换个话题吧。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/g3kmp8xqqj4f4mkel6hzaubwk897fgg.mp3","text":"塞雷娅？您说她在罗德岛？是来找伊芙利特吗......那时候她明明头也不回地就离开了，为什么现在还要......！","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/4tx12lgpw43qbse9sqvtha7th87heqs.mp3","text":"我不会让伊芙利特见塞雷娅的。也请您相信，我这样做，是对伊芙利特好......！","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/fntabo0g240l2f5oeg2pd4f2o0pkztq.mp3","text":"和我一样，您也在试图清除矿石病吗？听说罗德岛的医疗技术开发也与您有关。呵呵，对我们这些研究者来说，这真是让人憧憬呢。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/50vmjsc9kgj6fow8sh0kp6bvd7a44wp.mp3","text":"......博士，睡着了吗？算了，剩下的工作我来做吧。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/r5wtqjpz72azk57pc06mjacjk3xinjp.mp3","text":"奥利维亚·赫默，莱茵生命医学研究所的源石研究者。清除这个世界上所有的矿石病，这是我的愿望，即使为此面临生命危险也不会改变。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/re7g57g279nz7zec0bg7h5rfi6uxtn4.mp3","text":"我会好好运用这份新的力量。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/igmzab16yn8nffvywylrd8e5477uwkc.mp3","text":"我开发的药物非常有效吗？太好了，比起晋升，这个消息更让我高兴。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/suirluhpay2iji9tlt9cfe7jowefqh4.mp3","text":"博士，我等待着，等待着从这片大地上彻底清除矿石病的那天，与您并肩作战，共同研究，这一天，也许终会到来......","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/opfzjruh65iv5gy6dirje2e1k7nzh4d.mp3","text":"明白，我会做好支援工作。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/i9yh452mx9d131voiksl13r7mgugzsg.mp3","text":"队员们，全力以赴地战斗吧。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/84nudg9vu4z7brt5vfaxsy4y6wyk4rk.mp3","text":"这场战斗，也是源石的错吗？","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/0dp6lt1u15vn5jj15p9d1mymbdfa7dp.mp3","text":"观察并确定他们的感染类型，这对实验很有用。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/31zx6m8zvwm8y31phx859ox1bhn4rbd.mp3","text":"博士，让我去吧。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/af/j0cmoe2hinr7h0bmmn40jzba8yz5rec.mp3","text":"没有异常。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/eev7l053vzfksqgl7sqolkecpz1wxy0.mp3","text":"集中精力。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/73qac0rshev1t2tkf273ia79v5ocerj.mp3","text":"保持冷静。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/8wbxewhbvcyupdy5eowb4kwzihzylbr.mp3","text":"我会治好你的。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/nchwgk2twubcplyzhptcirj5zd86g1i.mp3","text":"别慌张。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/39/rorq2kqwz3q0rgz72n9qa9fh2dx7cjk.mp3","text":"去吧。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/cuwyk07nuqbjii5tolilgx8z1ky2no0.mp3","text":"帮助大家。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/ectksk4ik3n016h6in50tp2dfwh99ng.mp3","text":"为了战胜比现在更强的敌人，我们难道也要更多利用源石的力量......吗？","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/5zemomexzu44wia7o98kjgrvbr0hvps.mp3","text":"医疗组请马上进行组织采取，这将成为此地区的感染样本。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/r6yql2tsvsf7k30oez0ilro75baio0o.mp3","text":"请伤者冷静下来，医疗组会为各位进行治疗。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/jm48r7honlzwyi3tmjg9emu34m3kg5c.mp3","text":"......现在不是沮丧的时候，我们必须立刻撤退。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/jizpvwk551cxzv9gv5g76038z4ksrmk.mp3","text":"这个房间......糟糕，是那种会让人产生睡意的设计风格！","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/7nnl4yvfidlfoyldu5st4l7usliirq9.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/k0fn3bve9sri9pe9qen6gkziqnatued.mp3","text":"博士，您最近变得更温柔了呢。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/4pwipqqxmsicfjndk17n8im5o1tfrc7.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/izi5b4hpigfubelpmh1xe18vjjnyo6s.mp3","text":"博士，您看到伊芙利特了吗？外面在放烟花，我很担心......嗯，带她回房间睡觉之后，我打算去实验室。我没有忘记这是什么日子，只是想用这种方式来面对新的一年，面对未来。新年快乐。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/05avhnkcj8e8eebif08o1lxa16zhtta.mp3","text":"您好，博士。","alt":"voice/char_108_silent/cn_042.mp3"}]}}